Package: insitu
Title: Estimating in situ Speciation on Island Systems
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kristen", "Martinet", , "kmartinet@arizona.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Cristian", "Román-Palacios", , "cromanpa@arizona.edu", role = c("aut", "ctb"))
    )
Description: Estimates in situ speciation events and quantifies their
    contribution to biodiversity in discrete geographical units, with a focus
    on islands and island-like environments. Nodes in a phylogeny are
    classified as in situ speciation, colonization, or dispersal events.
    The package also computes diversity decomposition metrics and includes
    functions to visualize the results.
